WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.779 --> 00:00:01.760
- [Announcer] Ferrari.

00:00:01.760 --> 00:00:03.159
Lamborghini.

00:00:03.159 --> 00:00:08.072
Simply the ultimate in
vehicular luxury, right?

00:00:08.072 --> 00:00:11.840
Well, in Italy, Lamborghini
started out associated

00:00:11.840 --> 00:00:13.811
with tractors.

00:00:13.811 --> 00:00:17.301
So how did Lamborghini evolve
from tilling the fields

00:00:17.301 --> 00:00:20.598
of Bologna to becoming one
of the top luxury brands

00:00:20.598 --> 00:00:22.080
on the planet?

00:00:22.080 --> 00:00:25.667
Through a personal insult
delivered by this man.

00:00:25.667 --> 00:00:27.334
Mr. Ferrari himself.

00:00:35.546 --> 00:00:39.576
- Ferruccio Lamborghini was
a real man with real skills.

00:00:39.576 --> 00:00:42.947
As an Italian Air Force
mechanic during World War II,

00:00:42.947 --> 00:00:46.376
he set up a little auto
repair shop in Northern Italy,

00:00:46.376 --> 00:00:48.435
buying surplus military machines

00:00:48.435 --> 00:00:51.827
and converting them into tractors.

00:00:51.827 --> 00:00:53.744
He made a lot of money.

00:00:55.937 --> 00:00:57.141
- So much money

00:00:57.141 --> 00:01:01.061
that he could finally
afford a Ferrari 250 GT,

00:01:01.061 --> 00:01:03.482
a true sign that he had made it.

00:01:03.482 --> 00:01:05.653
(car engine roaring)

00:01:05.653 --> 00:01:07.653
But there was a problem.

00:01:08.551 --> 00:01:13.482
So he took a trip to visit Enzo
Ferrari himself to complain.

00:01:13.482 --> 00:01:17.573
Ferrari, notorious for
writing off his customers,

00:01:17.573 --> 00:01:20.518
threw shade at the tycoon tractor maker,

00:01:20.518 --> 00:01:24.420
exclaiming, "The problem
is not with the car,

00:01:24.420 --> 00:01:26.468
but with the driver.

00:01:26.468 --> 00:01:29.397
Go focus on your tractors."

00:01:29.397 --> 00:01:30.940
Game on.

00:01:30.940 --> 00:01:34.670
Lamborghini was furious
about Ferrari's fiery affront

00:01:34.670 --> 00:01:36.900
and decided to build his own car,

00:01:36.900 --> 00:01:39.198
just to spite him.

00:01:39.198 --> 00:01:42.867
Lamborghini poached a few
of Ferrari's ex-employees

00:01:42.867 --> 00:01:45.797
and told them to get to work
on beating their former boss

00:01:45.797 --> 00:01:47.497
at his own game.

00:01:47.497 --> 00:01:49.297
The team succeeded,

00:01:49.297 --> 00:01:52.969
with the result being
the Lamborghini 350 GT.

00:01:52.969 --> 00:01:54.969
And the rest is history.

00:01:56.286 --> 00:01:58.574
- (speaks in foreign language)

00:01:58.574 --> 00:02:00.407
- I already said that.

